      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "114",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Israel went out of Egypt, the house of Jacob from a people of strange language;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judah was his sanctuary,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel his dominion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sea saw",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and fled: Jordan was driven back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The mountains skipped like rams,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the little hills like lambs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ailed",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thee, O thou sea, that thou fleddest? thou Jordan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou wast driven back?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye mountains,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye skipped like rams;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye little hills, like lambs?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tremble, thou earth, at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the God of Jacob;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 114:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which turned the rock",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "into",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.114.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.114.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a standing water, the flint into a fountain of waters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.114.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.114.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
